    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d598">

                <pb facs="0627" n="511" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg511"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.516/72.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Blanchard to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-02-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 11, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>At the request of Bank, Legation protested on the 9th instant by note to the
                    Haitian Government against the issue of Treasury notes and also against the
                    taking of the Treasury service from the Bank as violating contract of Bank and
                    therefore injurious to American interests therein. French Minister has also
                    filed protest.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Blanchard.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
